            "text": "The suit over San Jose's carry-permit costs now also targets the 2022 rule requiring owners to insure against accidental or negligent use, plus a $25 annual fee. Liability insurance and self-defense legal coverage are different products: a clear, non-Bend explainer opportunity.",
